  m_Name: Caravan Event
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Scriptable_Objects.EventSO
  Description: You pass a broken caravan with supplies and bodies littered about.
    Whatever happened here was recent. You could take what remains despite the carnage.
  DefaultSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2835479164c77b5448ed2aac863df6d8, type: 3}
  HoverSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6de27e2816d9cf3429c309ac7c27814e, type: 3}
  TrustDescription: The bodies appear to have been mauled upon closer inspection.
    Not many dare approach. Some are unhappy to defile the scene, but it would be
    a waste to let what they have rot.
  RejectDescription: You say a prayer and help bury the bodies before leaving.
